{"baseRefName":"main","body":"## Summary\n- refresh the P0110/pacific Android 16 no-Host UI/UX evidence from current main after PR #691\n- add focused Android JVM source-contract guardrails proving no-Host clipboard and file-transfer control-surface refresh paths stay away from system clipboard, picker, file-read, Downloads-write, and protocol-send boundaries\n- update README evidence links/counts to the after-691 record while keeping Host-backed clipboard/file-transfer E2E gates explicitly open\n\n## Scope and limits\n- The retained evidence is no-Host only: no Vibe Screen, MacHost, or Telemachus macOS GUI was launched while recording it\n- The retained evidence used no Swift host launch, no Screen Recording/Accessibility/Microphone/Keychain/TCC/System Settings changes, and no adb reverse tcp:54321 tcp:54321 mapping\n- This does not prove Android ClipboardManager <-> macOS NSPasteboard E2E, Android/macOS file-transfer bytes landing, Host-backed transport, LAN/Internet behavior, video decode, input forwarding, or Xiaomi 13/fuxi behavior\n- This PR does not close the clipboard or file-transfer Android/macOS E2E gates\n\n## Verification\n- P0110 no-Host instrumentation passed 87/87 on Nubia P0110 / pacific / Android 16 / API 36\n- Focused JVM control-surface contracts passed 19/19 across MainActivityClipboardSystemBoundaryContractTest, MainActivityFileTransferSystemBoundaryContractTest, and MainActivityTransferReadinessContractTest\n- Evidence pre/post adb reverse list samples were empty; evidence pre/post lsof tcp:54321 checks returned no listener rows\n- Evidence package checksum verification passed with shasum -a 256 -c SHA256SUMS\n- git diff --check passed\n\n## PR creation note\nThe initial gh pr create invocation used a shell-quoted Markdown body that accidentally treated inline command snippets as command substitutions on the local machine. Those substitutions produced local errors, and one adb reverse command created a tcp:54321 mapping after the evidence was already captured and committed. I immediately removed that mapping, then confirmed adb reverse --list is empty, no local tcp:54321 listener exists, and no MacHost/Vibe Screen/Telemachus/swift-run process is running. The retained evidence package remains the source of truth for this PR and records empty pre/post no-Host boundary samples.\n","closedAt":"2026-09-08T05:52:02Z","files":[{"path":"README.md","additions":9,"deletions":6,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"baseline/AndroidClient/app/src/test/java/dev/telemachus/display/MainActivityClipboardSystemBoundaryContractTest.kt","additions":36,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"baseline/AndroidClient/app/src/test/java/dev/telemachus/display/MainActivityFileTransferSystemBoundaryContractTest.kt","additions":61,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-08-nubia-p0110-no-host-uiux-after-691-current-main/README.md","additions":147,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-08-nubia-p0110-no-host-uiux-after-691-current-main/SHA256SUMS","additions":31,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-08-nubia-p0110-no-host-uiux-after-691-current-main/android-test-report/css/base-style.css","additions":162,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-08-nubia-p0110-no-host-uiux-after-691-current-main/android-test-report/css/style.css","additions":86,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-08-nubia-p0110-no-host-uiux-after-691-current-main/android-test-report/dev.telemachus.display.ClipboardConfirmationDialogLayoutInstrumentedTest.html","additions":91,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/changes/2026-08-22-android-ui-ux-audit/evidence/2026-09-08-nubia-p0110-no-host-uiux-after-691-current-main/a